<title>INDIA: India Tata Tea up 6 pct after results.</title>
<headline>India Tata Tea up 6 pct after results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of India's Tata Tea rose 18.25 rupees, or 5.7 percent, to 338.0 at the Bombay exchange on Thursday as foreign funds bought into the stock after the firm posted higher than expected 1996/97 profits, traders said.</p>
